    "problem": [
      {
        "text": "All three model-level `default_chat_prompt` overrides returned ChatML-style `im_start`/`im_end` blocks. The pinned Dots templates instead use dedicated system, user and response markers; the pinned Ernie PT templates use a begin-of-sentence marker and `User: `/`Assistant: ` labels. The mismatch was in the single-request helper, not in the existing interactive chat modes.",
