          "call_d2ce101610b0407dadd092b128e7947d"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "reasoning": [
      {
        "text": "The new strings match the existing interactive formatters for a single pending turn given the same system text. That supports reading the fix as alignment with each family's prompt syntax, not as an attempt to reproduce every checkpoint's template policy. The base helper explicitly documents that it does not consult the checkpoint's Jinja template.",
        "basis": "inference",
        "evidence": [
