    "impact": [
      {
        "text": "Direct callers of the three overrides get different prompt strings with the same signature and return type. The only literal call found in the whole parent tree was `examples/imgsearch.py`: it formats an image alias plus a stripped question, then passes the text and image embeddings to the tokenizer. That script first requires a `vision` component; all three affected configurations expose only `text`, so its normal path does not reach these overrides. The literal search does not establish reach for dynamic or external callers.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
