      },
      {
        "text": "`examples/chat.py --mode dots` and `--mode ernie` already select separate history-aware formatters. The loop uses their special-token encoding, BOS settings and stop conditions, not the model helper. This patch changes none of those settings, nor model loading, tensor lookup or architecture dispatch.",
